      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10098",
      "speaker": "shizuku",
      "text": "（ファミリーとは本当に底知れないものだな。 まだまだ多くの学ぶべき『知らないこと』がありそうだ）",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_19/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_19_110.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_19/adv_script_kadan_005_1_19-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_19-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "6183287636457a4070d477b62405ecaab55931eeba7083780880c56fa81641b6",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_19_110.wav",
      "subtitle": "（Family真的是无法捉摸啊。\n看来还有许许多多需要学习的『未知之事』）",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "73c3de4430635e0142e13b3282e332d9049d4d110bf6b3e3739a225a6864fa9c",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_19/adv_script_kadan_005_1_19-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_19-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_surprise_11198_016",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_surprise_11198",
      "speaker": "shizuku",
      "text": "当初の予定では朝一番にお祝いするということだったが…… こういう場合どうしたらよいのだ？",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_surprise_11198/adv_voice_surprise_11198_016.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_surprise_11198/adv_script_surprise_11198-Episode/adv_script_surprise_11198-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "b3ebe4c23a6e84d7abd2bada26ecb2e5157fb557d526f11c4cb09edbb6960f54",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_surprise_11198_016.wav",
      "subtitle": "原定计划是明早第一时间为她庆祝的……\n遇到这种情况，该怎么办才好？",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "6e3ce2a658ffdfe53f1b6b17186b9c834297324d1f8ed30f35f0f902e8666da6",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_surprise_11198/adv_script_surprise_11198-Text/adv_script_surprise_11198-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_14_052",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10093",
      "speaker": "shizuku",
      "text": "……私も、満員にできなかった。 今日ライブをしても、ホームは守れないのだろうか……",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_14/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_14_052.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_14/adv_script_kadan_005_1_14-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_14-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "5db3929368e106db5f465b1f28f8e8e56e676ce4a40327db9fa7b0b5b5f240d3",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_14_052.wav",
      "subtitle": "……我也没能让这里全场爆满。\n就算今天演出顺利，也守不住这个Home了吗……",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "0458c82e62addf10071b1cbc069448e06c4fe3e53c2b62d0cf0ab4828c4121b7",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_14/adv_script_kadan_005_1_14-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_14-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
